This licence covers the SOFTWARE in this repository: the C++ engine under
src/, include/ and apps/, the Python package under python/, and the build
scripts (bootstrap.sh, cmake/).

It does NOT cover the morphology data under data/, which is third-party and
carries its own terms:

  data/morphologies_balanced/, data/morph.asc
    Blue Brain NMC Portal reconstructions, (c) EPFL/Blue Brain Project,
    redistributed under the portal's Terms of Use: non-commercial use only,
    and citation is a condition of use:
    Markram et al. 2015, Cell 163:456-492; Ramaswamy et al. 2015, Front
    Neural Circuits 9:44; Reimann et al. 2015, Front Comput Neurosci 9:120.
    Terms: https://bbp.epfl.ch/nmc-portal/downloads.html

  data/morphologies/
    The clone-inclusive archive of the same reconstructions. Not
    redistributed: the directory is gitignored apart from its README.

  data/validation/
    Allen Cell Types Database reconstructions, downloaded rather than
    redistributed (the directory is gitignored and starts empty). See
    data/validation/README.md and celltypes.brain-map.org for their terms.

Nothing above relicenses that data.
